  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat, add 1 tablespoon of oil and cook the chopped onion until caramelized, about 8 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the Bavarian sausages to the skillet, cook until browned on all sides, about 3-4 minutes per side.",
    "Pour in the sweet sherry and water, cover the skillet, and steam the sausages until cooked through, about 8-10 minutes.",
    "Remove the cooked sausages from the skillet, and serve with caramelized onion, Dijon mustard, and chopped parsley on the side, warmed through."
